?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"My take on this is that we should do the same we're doing in a number of places.\r\n\r\nMake the default `true`, so existing behavior for existing projects is maintained.\r\n\r\nThen in the create new project, set the value to false, so for new projects the dropdown ends up being hidden.\r\n\r\nSo opt-out for existing projects\r\nOpt-in for new projects.\r\n\r\nBest of both worlds. ","created_at":"2026-04-07T00:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T00:02:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117754#discussion_r3042243329","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117754","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3042243329"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117754#discussion_r3042243329"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117754"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3042243329/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":569,"original_line":569,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2975921901,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3042517900","pull_request_review_id":4065393347,"id":3042517900,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc61WSOM","diff_hunk":"@@ -566,6 +566,8 @@ void EditorSettings::_load_defaults(Ref<ConfigFile> p_extra_config) {\n #endif\n \tEDITOR_SETTING(Variant::BOOL, PROPERTY_HINT_NONE, \"interface/editor/appearance/collapse_main_menu\", is_android_editor, \"\")\n \n+\tEDITOR_SETTING(Variant::BOOL, PROPERTY_HINT_NONE, \"interface/editor/appearance/show_renderer_selector\", false, \"\")","path":"editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp","commit_id":"85b45fd58efd9f4351b0f901aa7883de95a59925","original_commit_id":"85b45fd58efd9f4351b0f901aa7883de95a59925","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There is an easy solution here. Merge this PR and see how many users actually miss the setting being right there. We don't need to speculate how many people find it useful. Just default to false for now, if enough people complain after Beta 1 than we default to true in a subsequent Beta 2. \r\n\r\nI am very skeptical about the need for this dropdown in the first place. First, it was added for the benefit of engine developers, not users. Second, we have several experienced developers telling us that it hurts the UX of the editor (especially on Mobile), we should listen to them. \r\n\r\nThe only mention of this being needed is from Bastiaan saying he is aware of developers who are targeting PCVR and mobile VR that benefit from rapid switching between the renders while developing (since they want to preview what the mobile version will look like when running on the PCVR headset). This is a niche segment within a niche platform, we shouldn't be taking up valuable editor space to cater to it. \r\n\r\nFinally, if we default to false, we might as well not make the change at all. Users will never wade through the already bloated list of editor settings to find the setting to disable the bad default UX. We should default to behaviour that is good for the _majority_ of users, and then let the users with specific needs enable the specific editor setting for their use-case. ","created_at":"2026-04-07T02:04:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T02:04:21Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117754#discussion_r3042517900","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117754","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3042517900"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117754#discussion_r3042517900"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117754"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3042517900/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":569,"original_line":569,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2975921901,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]